    "rules": {
      "stay_exposed_choose_safe": "Loaded collector; staying reachable by enemy collector with cargo <= ours; at least one potential non-lethal alternative with no current ally there; no enemy base in neighborhood. Selected means any chosen non-lethal landing; selected_free_safe additionally excludes ally-occupied cells. Actual allied arrivals exclude recruits. Reach includes an opponent staying or moving one cell.",
      "home": "Cargo >=100, off base and exactly one home adjacent, home currently empty; at least one other unoccupied-by-other-allies and non-lethal alternative; neighborhood disjoint from enemy bases. Selected = actually commanded into home. Stratify by minimum cargo of any enemy collector which could arrive there (zero moveCost), or planter-only reach, or no enemy can arrive. Last10 = t289..298.",
      "chase": "Empty collector adjacent to exactly one viable positive-cargo enemy collector on a non-base square. No enemy zero-cargo collector can counterreach the target (a tie for minimum kills all; only a unique lightest collector survives). Selected = command into the opponent's current square. A recorded capture requires that enemy stayed, target disappeared and attacking collector survived. This does not label a worker's intention or success elsewhere after its target moves."
